    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to slither across floors and walls in Cube Snake, a fresh take on the beloved Arcade and Brick-Phone Classic and nom nom nom your way to the top of your personal or global leaderboards! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to explore a 3D cubic environment, collect fruit pouches, and avoid falling off the walls in an addictive and endless game, perfect for amplifying your procrastination! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cube Snake you use two buttons to turn left and right and to help you crawl on the floor and walls. You must pay attention to where your food spawns, eat it, and grow your snake as long as you can make it, but why are we telling you this, we\u2019re sure you already know! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890500/extras/599dfff64e24ae402e5a89ca0a7f2174.poster.avif?t=1738574514\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890500/extras/599dfff64e24ae402e5a89ca0a7f2174.webm?t=1738574514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890500/extras/599dfff64e24ae402e5a89ca0a7f2174.mp4?t=1738574514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl: Use two buttons to turn left and right and crawl on the floor and walls. It\u2019s isometric!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat: Pay attention to where your food randomly spawns, and go munch it up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow: Every time you eat, your tail grows longer, so get lengthy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive: Be careful to not cross the red line and\u2026 not to eat your own tail!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score: The higher the better, but if it's short it's ok too, aim to beat your own score or fight for the top global rankings! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890500/extras/0a6473cfdb2a293fe5995493683fbdee.poster.avif?t=1738574514\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890500/extras/0a6473cfdb2a293fe5995493683fbdee.webm?t=1738574514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890500/extras/0a6473cfdb2a293fe5995493683fbdee.mp4?t=1738574514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on the latest generation graphics engine to prove that it has actually been almost 50 years since the original Snake, and because we want to appease those with a keen eye for beautiful graphics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to slither across floors and walls in Cube Snake, a fresh take on the beloved Arcade and Brick-Phone Classic and nom nom nom your way to the top of your personal or global leaderboards! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to explore a 3D cubic environment, collect fruit pouches, and avoid falling off the walls in an addictive and endless game, perfect for amplifying your procrastination! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cube Snake you use two buttons to turn left and right and to help you crawl on the floor and walls. You must pay attention to where your food spawns, eat it, and grow your snake as long as you can make it, but why are we telling you this, we\u2019re sure you already know! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890500/extras/599dfff64e24ae402e5a89ca0a7f2174.poster.avif?t=1738574514\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890500/extras/599dfff64e24ae402e5a89ca0a7f2174.webm?t=1738574514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890500/extras/599dfff64e24ae402e5a89ca0a7f2174.mp4?t=1738574514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl: Use two buttons to turn left and right and crawl on the floor and walls. It\u2019s isometric!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat: Pay attention to where your food randomly spawns, and go munch it up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow: Every time you eat, your tail grows longer, so get lengthy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive: Be careful to not cross the red line and\u2026 not to eat your own tail!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score: The higher the better, but if it's short it's ok too, aim to beat your own score or fight for the top global rankings! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890500/extras/0a6473cfdb2a293fe5995493683fbdee.poster.avif?t=1738574514\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890500/extras/0a6473cfdb2a293fe5995493683fbdee.webm?t=1738574514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890500/extras/0a6473cfdb2a293fe5995493683fbdee.mp4?t=1738574514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on the latest generation graphics engine to prove that it has actually been almost 50 years since the original Snake, and because we want to appease those with a keen eye for beautiful graphics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Slither through a retro-futuristic cyberpunk world in this 3D Cubic take of the classic 1976 &amp; 1998 Snake games!",
